      "writtenOn": "2022-04-26T16:23:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can some of these conversions be done with `.into()` rather than `as _`, to ensure that they are only widening conversions and nothing gets truncated?",
      "revId": "4f3a87446a1dc1fa3e98c0cc4f62304c3ad08062",
