        "id": 1380243
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-27T12:25:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Aha okay. I guess it\u0027s pretty unlikely to overflow, but maybe `.try_into().unwrap()` would be safer, so it panics rather than just silently truncating?",
